Abstract = {New cataloging standard; Resource Description and Access (RDA) become
   one of the biggest issues in Library and Information Science field. The
   implementation of the RDA in Malaysia perhaps will enhance the
   accessibility of the library materials because of the evolutions of the
   information world and how the information professional work. Purpose of
   this study is to develop a suitable framework of explaining and
   predicting librarian acceptance of the new cataloging standard in
   Malaysia. The research model for librarian acceptance towards new
   cataloging standard is constructed based on motivation factors and
   technology acceptance literature review.},
