Organization = {NATO},
Abstract = {In recent years the question of coping and resiliency has become a
   crucial element in crisis intervention. This chapter will review the
   model developed some 30 years ago known as the BASIC Ph model, and its
   roots in the foundational theories of psychology and in research
   worldwide on coping and resiliency. Some of the concepts related to
   coping and resiliency will be reviewed, together with findings from our
   studies and suggestions for an integrated model to approach major
   incidents will be presented.},
